{"id":"fidel-bdf97b8a3d","am":"Put fidel sounds together to read a word. ቤ (bé) + ት (t) makes ቤት (bet), house. ላ (la) + ም (m) makes ላም (lam), cow. Say each sound, then say them faster until they become one word.","ctx":"English lesson text containing Amharic words: check the Amharic words, transliterations and meanings"}
