{"id":"fidel-594ab030a7","am":"The Amharic numbers to ten are አንድ, ሁለት, ሦስት, አራት, አምስት, ስድስት (sidist), ሰባት (sebat), ስምንት (siment), ዘጠኝ (zeteny), and አሥር (asir). Ethiopia also has its own number signs, the Ge'ez numerals: ፩ ፪ ፫ ፬ ፭ ፮ ፯ ፰ ፱ ፲.","ctx":"English lesson text containing Amharic words: check the Amharic words, transliterations and meanings"}
