{"id":"fidel-725efc1f7c","am":"ሰላም (selam) means hello and peace. አመሰግናለሁ (ameseginalehu) means thank you. ይቅርታ (yikirta) means sorry or excuse me. Some Amharic words change for a boy or a girl: እባክህ (ebakih) is please to a boy, and እባክሽ (ebakish) is please to a girl.","ctx":"English lesson text containing Amharic words: check the Amharic words, transliterations and meanings"}
